 driver by obeying the traffic rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't turn on the KNOCKOUT switch in the Options menu,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or enter certain areas of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514570/extras/7f7d5d9b24b174b7e137925c9b9c9083.avif?t=1788166963\" width=610 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514570/extras/208a4d8f76ef4f4b330a82534009b702.avif?t=1788166963\" width=610 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, for a change of pace! To relieve some stress?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop in your car and let's go on a carefree drive exploring the city!</p>", "short_description": "Want a change of pace? Need to relieve some stress? Get behind the wheel and drive around town! You'll find some crazy mini-games around town, as well as a KnockOutDrive Mode that makes you invincible, but remember to drive safely! Let's Go on a carefree drive!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514570/cd986711505e6292c69aca8817838a1589d45054/header.jpg?t=1788166963", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514570/2c27ac0d11b991d313f362fcdc85f23a5c03c598/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788166963", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514570/2c27ac0d11b991d313f362fcdc85f23a5c03c598/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788166963", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-7200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</st